{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2023-05-31 11:00:00', 'title': 'DOJONETWORKS REPLACES CISCO WITH IP INFUSION', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #ARCHITECHS--IP INFUSION, MARKET LEADER IN CARRIER-GRADE NETWORKING SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT DOJONETWORKS, A RAPIDLY GROWING INTERNET SERVICE PROVIDER FOR MULTI-DWELLING UNITS (MDUS), HAS CHOSEN AN OPEN NETWORKING STRATEGY TO UPGRADE ITS TRANSPORT NETWORK INFRASTRUCTURE. DOJO WILL BE USING A COMBINATION OF IP INFUSION OCNOS® SOFTWARE WITH EDGECORE NETWORKS OPEN NETWORKING HARDWARE TO UPGRADE AND INTEROPERATE WITH ITS EXISTING CISCO AND JUNIPER EQUIPMENT.'}